<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs up mostly $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs up mostly $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts sold mostly $0.50 Higher. Demand was moderate to good on a light to moderate movement. Top $58.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  56.00-57.50 Few 58.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  52.00-56.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  47.50-52.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 42.00-44.50</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 44.50-46.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs. 47.00-51.00 Few over 600 lbs. 52.00</p>
</text>
